    "objective": "Win enough card points under the chosen contract by taking tricks and controlling key trumps.",
    "gameplay": "Players follow suit when possible, otherwise play trump when required, and otherwise discard. Highest trump wins trumped tricks; otherwise highest card in the led suit wins. Contract and talon handling determine risk and reward each deal.",
